Method Endpoint Purpose POST <code>/conversations</code> Create conversation GET <code>/conversations</code> List owned conversations GET <code>/conversations/{conversation_id}</code> Read conversation metadata PATCH <code>/conversations/{conversation_id}</code> Rename/archive conversation DELETE <code>/conversations/{conversation_id}</code> Delete or soft-delete conversation GET <code>/conversations/{conversation_id}/messages</code> Read ordered messages POST <code>/conversations/{conversation_id}/messages</code> Append message and create run GET <code>/conversations/{conversation_id}/stream</code> Stream messages/run events <p>Create message request:</p> <pre><code>{
  "role": "user",
  "content": {"text": "Summarize this project"},
  "agent_id": "uuid",
  "metadata": {}
}
</code></pre> <p>Create message response:</p> <pre><code>{
  "message_id": "uuid",
  "run_id": "uuid",
  "conversation_id": "uuid",
  "status": "queued",
  "correlation_id": "uuid"
}
</code></pre>

Endpoint Notes <code>POST /chat/stream</code> [EXTEND] Accept Bearer tokens and an <code>Idempotency-Key</code>; accept <code>metadata.household_id</code> and <code>metadata.grounding</code> (bool) <code>GET /api/v1/conversations</code>, <code>GET /conversations/{id}/messages</code> [EXISTING] cursor-paginated history <code>POST /api/v1/conversations/{id}/messages</code> [EXISTING] non-streaming send with <code>Idempotency-Key</code> <p>Request <pre><code>{
  "message": "What did we decide about the electricity bill?",
  "conversation_id": "conv_...",
  "device_id": "dev_5c21...",
  "metadata": { "household_id": "0192f6b2-...", "grounding": true, "locale": "hi-IN" }
}
</code></pre> Response: <code>application/x-ndjson</code>, one JSON object per line: <pre><code>{"type":"status","text":"Searching your notes…"}
{"type":"tool_start","tool":"notes_search","args":{"q":"electricity bill"}}
{"type":"tool_end","tool":"notes_search","ok":true}
{"type":"thought","text":"Found 2 relevant notes."}
{"type":"done","conversation_id":"conv_...","message_id":"msg_...","reply":"You decided to pay by UPI before 12 Nov.","sources":[{"note_id":"0192f6d1-...","title":"Electricity bill"}]}
</code></pre> Error line: <code>{"type":"error","status":503,"detail":"Model is not available"}</code>.</p> <p>Grounding is server-side: the server's notes-search tool only returns notes the caller may read (same visibility rule as §6.1). The client never uploads its notes to the chat endpoint.</p>

WP Deliverable Touches WP-S1 <code>family</code> migration (§6.1), households + roles + permission checks <code>auth/migrations.py</code>, new <code>vira/family/</code> WP-S2 Token auth: pairing, refresh, scopes, <code>Authorization: Bearer</code> dependency, platform role <code>member</code> <code>auth/</code>, <code>api/deps.py</code>, new <code>api/routes_pairing.py</code> WP-S3 Sync service (<code>apply_op</code>, change log, visibility filter, compaction, <code>/sync/*</code>) new <code>vira/family/sync.py</code>, <code>api/routes_sync.py</code> WP-S4 SSE <code>sync.changed</code>, <code>device.revoked</code>; long-poll <code>/sync/wait</code> <code>api/streams.py</code> WP-S5 Notes-search tool for chat grounding with per-user visibility <code>vira/tools/</code>, <code>agent/Agents/chat_agent.py</code> WP-S6 Push registration + gateway client; notification policy new <code>vira/family/push.py</code> WP-S7 Attachments (v2) new <code>vira/family/attachments.py</code> WP-S8 <code>GET /client-config</code>, <code>PUT push-registration</code>, <code>/auth/me</code> extension <code>api/app.py</code> WP-S9 Push gateway service new repo / directory <p>New <code>config.yaml</code> block: <pre><code>family:
  token_ttl_seconds: 900
  refresh_ttl_days: 30
  pairing_ttl_seconds: 900
  limits: { max_note_bytes: 102400, max_attachment_bytes: 26214400, max_members: 12, max_ops_per_push: 200 }
  sync: { compaction_days: 30, trash_days: 30 }
  push: { enabled: true, gateway_url: "https://push.example.org" }
  tls: { lan_cert_path: ./data/tls/lan.pem, lan_key_path: ./data/tls/lan.key }
</code></pre></p>
